{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This is a demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your maid start living together after you lose your parents in a robbery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, the maid becomes overprotective of you after the incident, and you find yourself becoming more and more \u201cYandere\u201d in this slightly horrifying exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since this is Demo, there are few horror elements. However, the volume of Demo alone is enough to satisfy you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a demo version, so you will only be able to play up to the middle of the main storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, the demo version alone is enough to play for about an hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, there are some gimmicks that are only available in the demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version contains almost no horror elements, so even those who do not like horror can enjoy playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a prequel before the maid becomes a yandere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your maid have moved to a new house after losing your parents in a robbery. You have just moved and your new house has many problems, and you are trying to solve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the peaceful time with the maid. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve riddles and puzzles and get hints to unlock keys, fuse stashes, safes, and padlocks. Memos with hints will help you in your search. By following the notes, you may be able to get to the truth about the maid. This title is mouse and keyboard only. 1st person view and WASD keys to move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893780?t=1753988242","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893780?t=1753988242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893780/7865ef1901422672a17722a6baf39910f4741526/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753988242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893780/7865ef1901422672a17722a6baf39910f4741526/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753988242","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"There is a scene of a woman bathing."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This is a demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your maid start living together after you lose your parents in a robbery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, the maid becomes overprotective of you after the incident, and you find yourself becoming more and more \u201cYandere\u201d in this slightly horrifying exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since this is Demo, there are few horror elements. However, the volume of Demo alone is enough to satisfy you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a demo version, so you will only be able to play up to the middle of the main storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, the demo version alone is enough to play for about an hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, there are some gimmicks that are only available in the demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version contains almost no horror elements, so even those who do not like horror can enjoy playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a prequel before the maid becomes a yandere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your maid have moved to a new house after losing your parents in a robbery. You have just moved and your new house has many problems, and you are trying to solve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the peaceful time with the maid. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve riddles and puzzles and get hints to unlock keys, fuse stashes, safes, and padlocks. Memos with hints will help you in your search. By following the notes, you may be able to get to the truth about the maid. This title is mouse and keyboard only. 1st person view and WASD keys to move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","developers":["Tanciatco"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3607850","name":"Yandere Maid~Love-Crazed Maid~"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893780/1735bfce60a77da5e7d07a6fa2e9a10712ee8e36/header.jpg?t=1753988242","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"You are permitted to stream, record, and upload gameplay footage of this game. Both commercial and non-commercial use is allowed within the scope of our guidelines.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257171461,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171461/movie480.mp4?t=1753559187","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171461/movie_max.mp4?t=1753559187"},"name":"YandereMaidDEMOPV1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171461/6024892002f1fa5543e33fd111a8926fb0156895/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753559187","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171461/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753559187","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171461/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753559187"}}],"name":"\u30e4\u30f3\u30c7\u30ec\u30e1\u30a4\u30c9~Love-Crazed Maid~ Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<st